Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.49,0:00:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamou, Yamou...!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.85,0:00:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamou, Yamou!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.39,0:00:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.17,0:00:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.75,0:00:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.93,0:00:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-Gi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.91,0:00:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.97,0:01:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.63,0:01:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The card I've just drawn will\Ndestroy you. Enough talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.15,0:01:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.31,0:01:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for you to lose it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.59,0:01:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have destroyed my dark\Nsanctuary and stopped its magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.31,0:01:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,but that was only temporary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.59,0:01:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A magic that powerful does not fade so\Neasily, so I summon Jouken the Spiritualist.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.65,0:01:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,what's your plan tell me i'm\Nstumped what's that do hey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.35,0:01:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,you tell us mr expert i've\Nnever seen it all right well
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.33,0:01:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,excuse me i thought you knew\Nthis stuff by sacrificing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.17,0:01:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,one card in my hand i can\Nuse jaugen the spiritualist
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.87,0:01:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,to destroy all specially\Nsummoned monsters on the field
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.09,0:01:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No way. Since Yugi summons\NDark Necro Fear with a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.07,0:01:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,magic card bakura can destroy\Nit But won't that release
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.33,0:01:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,the dark magic thing with all\Nthe eyeballs like last time
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.95,0:02:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So I sacrifice this card
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.53,0:02:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,To activate jogging to\Ndo my dirty work for me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.75,0:02:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,destroy doc necro fear
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.43,0:02:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You've sent Dark Necrofear back to the\Ncard graveyard. That means one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.51,0:02:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.42,0:02:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Sanctuary is returning And\Ncovering the field once again
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.33,0:02:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,in its powerful magic This\Nwill allow me to play the fifth
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.79,0:02:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,and last letter of the Destiny\NBoard Spelling out its complete
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.01,0:02:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,message A message that will\Nend this duel in your defeat,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.29,0:02:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuge. It all happens in one\Nmore turn. And so prepare to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.81,0:02:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,say goodbye to the Battle\NCity Finals and so much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.41,0:02:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,With this dark magic\Nback, I'm freaked out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.73,0:02:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, snap out of it, chicken boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.21,0:02:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you just going to curl up in a ball\Nor are you going to cheer for your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.63,0:02:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.81,0:02:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.99,0:03:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can get out\Nof this mess, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.27,0:03:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.43,0:03:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how tough to fight,\NYugi always pulls through.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.69,0:03:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not saying it's gonna\Nbe easy, but Yugi can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.47,0:03:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd suggest giving up now, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.73,0:03:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing you do can stop me from\Ncompleting the Destiny Board.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.41,0:03:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall reveal the last letter next turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.59,0:03:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,and you will automatically\Nlose everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.65,0:03:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And since I must sacrifice a monster\Nto maintain Dark Sanctuary...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.73,0:03:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Jaugen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.69,0:03:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll set one card face\Ndown and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.23,0:03:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, my ghost is back to possess\None of your monsters. I'm well aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.29,0:03:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But which one will I choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.45,0:03:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll just have to guess, eh, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.87,0:03:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But attacking me with a possessed\Nmonster could cost you your life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.11,0:03:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,so choose wisely. Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.49,0:03:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no intention of losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.89,0:03:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I outsmarted your spirit once\Nbefore, and I plan to do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.35,0:04:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The first thing I need\Nto do is figure out which
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.69,0:04:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,of my three monsters your\Nevil spirit possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.99,0:04:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.99,0:04:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my face-down card,\NDark Spirit of the Silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.85,0:04:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So no matter which monster\Nyou choose to attack with,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.89,0:04:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,my Dark Spirit of the Silent will shift
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.55,0:04:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,that attack to the\Nmonster that is possessed,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.89,0:04:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,which will then cause you to lose a large\Nnumber of your remaining life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.29,0:04:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If I attack, his ghost will\Ndrain the rest of my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.87,0:04:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I don't attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.05,0:04:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll play the last letter of the destiny\Nboard and I'll automatically lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.45,0:04:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And none of my Magic cards can stop them,\Neither, but I can't lose. It's your last.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.91,0:04:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,turn yuki just one move more and i shall
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.99,0:04:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,win you're done once and for all you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.61,0:04:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,can't win yuki i think he's right yuki\Nhas no options left come on show a little
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.91,0:04:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,fake will ya kristen i really hate to say\Nit but i think duke might be right about
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.89,0:05:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This Yugi can only attack once and when\Nhe does that ghost is gonna attack him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.33,0:05:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, is she right? No way Yugi's gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.03,0:05:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,win this but Joey but nothing he can do it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.99,0:05:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,we believe in you Yugi I've seen you get\Nout of way tougher spots in this before
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.09,0:05:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,so win this you're right Joey you can\Ndo it Yugi pull the sheet off his ghost
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.21,0:05:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,you can beat him Yugi come on that's what
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.37,0:05:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You think, can't you see I have already
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.65,0:05:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,defeated you just make your move so I\Ncan end this duel Yugi there is one card
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.43,0:05:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,in my deck that can save me but even if\NI'm lucky enough to draw it it may be
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.29,0:05:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,too dangerous to play then again what\Nchoice do I have I guess we only have one
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.43,0:05:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,hope to win this that's right if we don't\Nplay the Egyptian God card this turn
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.29,0:05:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna lose the duel and we've got\Nto win to save the world. We have to draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.45,0:05:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,it now yes we must the heart of the cards
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.31,0:06:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,will guide us now let's do this use your
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.21,0:06:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,egyptian god card you fool prepare to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.97,0:06:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,experience a power like no other\NCome on, heart of the cards
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.37,0:06:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrifice Dark Magician Girl,\NGamma the Magnet Warrior, And
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.73,0:06:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Shield Gardener To summon the\Nalmighty Swiper the Sky Dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.73,0:06:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,His Egyptian card. Card that\Nis the one Manic desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.37,0:07:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,but how can i defeat\Nthis all-powerful beast i
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.83,0:07:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,was so close what's that\Nuh joey the hugest dual
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.03,0:07:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster I've ever seen. It's\Nabout time he played it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.67,0:07:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,but Yugi better enjoy Slifer now,\Nbecause before the finals are over,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.05,0:07:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,that card will be in my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.65,0:07:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Slifer the Sky Dragon has\Nbeen played by the Pharaoh,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.83,0:07:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,just as my Millennium\NNecklace told me it would.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.85,0:07:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,All three Egyptian God Cards\Nare present on this aircraft,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.79,0:07:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,and my brother Merrick\Nmust not obtain them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.81,0:07:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The only one capable of\Npreventing Merrick from
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.45,0:07:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,seizing the power he desires\Nis the pharaoh himself
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.91,0:07:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, your Egyptian god card is powerful,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.45,0:07:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,but it does not guarantee your victory I've\Ncome much too far to lose now I'm afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.57,0:07:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,it's over I knew this was going to happen\NIn order for you to defeat that creature,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.79,0:08:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll need me Go on The\Nnumber of cards in his hand
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.77,0:08:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,determines how many attack points\NSlifer has. Listen carefully,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.41,0:08:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,he now holds three\Ncards That gives the all
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.69,0:08:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-powerful Slifer the Sky\NDragon 3,000 attack points
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.95,0:08:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And you only have 1,200\Nlife points remaining
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.61,0:08:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means that as soon as\NSlifer launches an attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.81,0:08:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,you're finished Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.95,0:08:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The ghost of Dark Sanctuary is\Nstill wandering the field, Yugi
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.75,0:08:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, my evil ghost,\Nit's time to attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.67,0:08:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Possess Slifer the Sky Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.99,0:08:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.19,0:08:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,My dark ghost had no effect!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.85,0:08:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, you have much to learn about\Nthe power of an Egyptian god card!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.55,0:08:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.11,0:08:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Slifer the Sky Dragon\Nis much too powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.01,0:08:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any more cards in my hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.37,0:08:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,nor do I have any monsters\Non the field to protect me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.11,0:08:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Sanctuary was my only hope,\Nbut Slifer has rendered it useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.47,0:09:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What can I do against the overwhelming\Npower of an Egyptian card card?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.67,0:09:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,All I have is my face-down trap\Ncard, and it's of no use to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.09,0:09:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.61,0:09:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,There's too much at stake for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.25,0:09:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I must win.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.61,0:09:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.87,0:09:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.15,0:09:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.37,0:09:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice going, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.95,0:09:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.69,0:09:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.83,0:09:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not over yet, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.61,0:09:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a plan for us. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.39,0:09:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Slifer the Sky Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.49,0:09:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack his life points with...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.73,0:09:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I sent something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.17,0:09:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.95,0:09:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.05,0:09:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What does he want?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.05,0:09:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't he attack me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.91,0:09:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you want to wait before you\Nattack with Slifer the Sky Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.61,0:09:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want, Merrick?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.13,0:09:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come up here and get a piece of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.29,0:09:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.53,0:10:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think you want to\Nmess with this guy, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.01,0:10:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They think he's me. Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.61,0:10:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Just who do you think you are, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.61,0:10:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just bust in here and\Ninterrupt someone else's duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.35,0:10:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.05,0:10:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.47,0:10:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kura is now under the\Ncontrol of the Millennium Rod,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.31,0:10:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and he will do only what I command\Nhim to do. What? How can that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.39,0:10:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought the spirit of the Millennium\NRing was in control of Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.07,0:10:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,True, but now I am in control\Nof both Bakura and the spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.69,0:10:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I shall prove it by\Nfreeing your friend's mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.77,0:10:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.07,0:10:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what do you think\Nyou're doing, Marek?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.77,0:10:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way to win this duel is for you\Nto release the mind of the boy you control.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.71,0:10:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.95,0:10:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Your opponent won't\Ndestroy his friend. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.11,0:10:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,My arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.45,0:10:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.11,0:10:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura! Bakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.81,0:10:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.29,0:11:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki, help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.81,0:11:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.69,0:11:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I doing here in this duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.67,0:11:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to my arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.77,0:11:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It is him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.27,0:11:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.81,0:11:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Without the spirit of\Nthe ring, he is weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.53,0:11:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, you may wish\Nto reconsider your attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.01,0:11:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The devastation caused\Nby Slifer the Sky Dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.73,0:11:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,could make your friend's\Ncondition even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.37,0:11:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.28,0:11:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you risk the health of your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.25,0:11:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a coward would do something\Nlike this to win a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.09,0:11:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a cheap trick, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.99,0:11:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura, hang in there, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.83,0:11:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Odeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.69,0:11:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll never attack his pathetic,\Ndefenseless friend now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.61,0:11:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Merrick always knows what's best.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.13,0:11:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I must obey his commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.21,0:11:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't feel very well, Yugi! Bakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.93,0:11:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.35,0:11:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You are not allowed to have contact\Nwith your opponent during a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.19,0:11:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Take one more step and\Nyou'll be disqualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.09,0:12:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to help Bakura. But if I do,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.47,0:12:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be kicked out of the finals and\Nthe entire world will be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.67,0:12:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the duel right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.47,0:12:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura needs to see a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.33,0:12:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to get him to a hospital now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.57,0:12:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the perfect plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.41,0:12:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,With Bakura in need of medical attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.91,0:12:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yami will lose the duel and his\NEgyptian god card will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.97,0:12:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't continue to duel,\Nyou will forfeit the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.41,0:12:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.91,0:12:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If I attack Makura to win\Nthis, I may hurt him even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.19,0:12:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I don't, I'll be disqualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.27,0:12:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, I'll make this\Ndecision very easy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.63,0:12:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.03,0:12:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I offer you a second warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.49,0:12:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your move or lose your\Nspot in the final. Now go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.93,0:12:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Chill out, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.91,0:12:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see the poor guy's injured?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.57,0:12:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.48,0:12:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of show you guys running here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.25,0:12:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down or you will be disqualified\Nfrom the finals as well? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.13,0:12:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.65,0:12:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If I come down there,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.43,0:12:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,he's not the only one who's going to need
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.27,0:13:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,medical attention Continue\Nthe duel now Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.31,0:13:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it. I've got to make a decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.77,0:13:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I risk Bakura's\Nhealth to save the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.79,0:13:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We're about to win this duel. Yugi\Nwould never attack his friend Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.35,0:13:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless he doesn't want to lose the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.27,0:13:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, someone help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.43,0:13:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't feel well at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.31,0:13:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I must lie down and get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.85,0:13:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.59,0:13:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek, I must step in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.67,0:13:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I still need Makora, and\NI can't risk his health.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.73,0:13:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He holds the Millennium\NRing and my spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.73,0:13:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I must protect him for the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.29,0:13:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.20,0:13:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.11,0:13:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.25,0:13:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.53,0:13:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back in control of\Nyour friend, Makora.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.21,0:13:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I still need him. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.29,0:14:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you plan on using your\NEgyptian god card, Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.43,0:14:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,why don't you use it on me right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.25,0:14:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.13,0:14:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, it's time. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.15,0:14:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Slifer and Sky Dragon. Attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.71,0:14:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's won this duel, but I'll\Nbe back to take what's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.01,0:14:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon I shall control the\Nworld's greatest power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.11,0:14:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And the winner is duelist\Nnumber three, Yugi Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.91,0:14:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Makura!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.82,0:14:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, lower that arena\Nand get them down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.93,0:14:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.03,0:14:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.05,0:14:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We got you, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.96,0:14:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,How's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.87,0:14:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Akura.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.79,0:14:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, so where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.27,0:14:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're with your friends now, Akura.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.29,0:14:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't look very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.83,0:14:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we need to get him to a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.05,0:15:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So why don't we get\NKaiba to land this day?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.13,0:15:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but first, help him onto my back\Nso that we can get him to his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.23,0:15:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.37,0:15:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad Bakura's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.53,0:15:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That was one of the toughest\Nchoices I ever had to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.57,0:15:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If the evil spirit didn't come back to\Nduel, I don't know what I would have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.29,0:15:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The Millennium Ring is\Na lot like my puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.79,0:15:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It holds an ancient spirit that depends\Non someone else so it can exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.83,0:15:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And even though the spirit of the ring is\Nevil and controls Bakura against his will,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.57,0:15:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,it seems to still need\NBakura in order to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.91,0:15:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's one major difference\Nbetween Bakura and Ayami. What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.73,0:15:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The spirit inside my item is my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.47,0:15:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And you and I are always there to support\Neach other, no matter what comes our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.75,0:15:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You were there to help me when\Nmy grandfather was in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.49,0:15:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, I'm here to help you rescue the\Nworld from evil. I promise. Together,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.99,0:16:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll figure out the secrets\Nof your ancient past and how
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.91,0:16:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,to unlock your hidden powers\Nbefore Merrick can take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.73,0:16:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Because your destiny is mine, too,\Nand we're going to win. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.87,0:16:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This was a tough duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.39,0:16:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,but thanks to our teamwork and the\Nheart of the cards, we came out on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.85,0:16:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we're headed for round two, and\Nwe're going to take it all the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.41,0:16:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as we stick together. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.29,0:16:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing will keep us from our destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.99,0:16:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.67,0:16:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.13,0:16:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,According to Battle City rules,\Nas the winner of the duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.25,0:16:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,you are entitled to take the rarest\Ncard from your opponent's deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.73,0:16:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's time to claim\Nyour prize, Yugi. No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.01,0:16:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Bakura's been\Nthrough enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.57,0:16:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Yugi won the first duel\Nof the Battle City finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.95,0:16:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew he would.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.47,0:16:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.91,0:16:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,With a card as powerful as Slifer\Nthe Sky Dragon in his deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.33,0:16:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi is difficult to defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.47,0:16:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.38,0:16:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless, of course, his opponent\Nalso has an Egyptian God card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.81,0:17:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura's been through a lot,\Nand he definitely needs rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.69,0:17:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But we gotta land this blimp\Nand get him to a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.77,0:17:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.71,0:17:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Some crazy stuff went down in that\Nduel, especially when Marek showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.41,0:17:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly happened back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.39,0:17:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,For some reason, Marek didn't want\Nthe Spirit of the Ring to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.01,0:17:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So when I was about to play my\NEgyptian God card and win the duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.83,0:17:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick used his Millennium\NRod to free the real Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.99,0:17:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Since he was injured,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.17,0:17:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick knew I would forfeit the\Nduel instead of attacking him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.01,0:17:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But the spirit must have been\Nafraid I would attack Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.27,0:17:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,because he took control\Nagain at the end. So wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.39,0:17:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,do you mean to tell me that the Dark\NSpirit of the Millennium Ring let you win?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.09,0:17:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup, because he depends\Non Bakura to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.03,0:17:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I attacked Bakura with Slifer,\Nthe spirit might have been in danger too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.01,0:17:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.17,0:17:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though the evil spirit was in control,\Nyou still ended up attacking Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.35,0:17:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.31,0:17:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,since the evil spirit was in control\Nof Bakura when I attacked him,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.95,0:17:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,the real Bakura was spared.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.71,0:18:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all so confusing,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.13,0:18:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,but it sounds like Marek and the\Nevil spirit were in this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.29,0:18:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I'm not sure how or why.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.75,0:18:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I just know we can't let\NMarek win this tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.15,0:18:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And hopefully, that evil spirit\Nwon't be coming back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.47,0:18:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know about you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.71,0:18:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,but I've had enough of evil spirits\Nand mind controlling for one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.13,0:18:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of that, Marek! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.35,0:18:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.43,0:18:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't get yourself in\Ntrouble again. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.81,0:18:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's time to talk\Nto Kaiba about getting
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.07,0:18:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura back into the\Nhospital as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.97,0:18:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Tristan's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.47,0:18:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get some help for Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.29,0:18:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's stop talking\Nabout it already and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.85,0:18:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.76,0:18:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stay here and keep an eye on Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.87,0:18:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, hang in there, Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.67,0:18:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Help is on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.99,0:18:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.19,0:18:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.11,0:18:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.29,0:18:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.35,0:18:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.67,0:18:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura's Millennium Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.35,0:18:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.89,0:19:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He had it around his neck\Nuntil the end of the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.47,0:19:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.69,0:19:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing seems to come and go all\Nthe time without any explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.67,0:19:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and your Egyptian god card\Nproperly blasted it sky high.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.55,0:19:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's get going, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.61,0:19:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.05,0:19:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,See you, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.25,0:19:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Later, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.35,0:19:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.73,0:19:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go.
